1
00:00:00,986 --> 00:00:02,946
(Leonard:)Okay.

2
00:00:07,409 --> 00:00:08,619
(Leonard:)Hey, how did it go?

3
00:00:09,327 --> 00:00:10,577
(Sheldon:)I got my job back.

4
00:00:10,745 --> 00:00:12,915
(Leonard:)Really? What happened?

5
00:00:13,081 --> 00:00:15,581
(Sheldon:)I'm not quite sure.

6
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:20,340
(Sheldon:)It involves a part of the human experience
that has always eluded me.

7
00:00:20,505 --> 00:00:23,135
Well, that narrows it down.

8
00:00:26,887 --> 00:00:30,767
(Mrs Cooper:)I'm very proud of you, honey.
You showed a lot of courage today.

9
00:00:31,558 --> 00:00:33,228
(Sheldon:)Thanks, Mom.

10
00:00:36,855 --> 00:00:38,235
(Sheldon:)- Mom?
- Mm-hm.

11
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:43,070
Is Dr. Gablehauser
going to be my new daddy?

12
00:00:45,197 --> 00:00:49,117
(Mrs Cooper:)We'll see. Sleep tight.

